---
import StudioLayout from '../../layouts/NounsMoneyStudioLayout.astro';
import DATA from '../../data/nouns-money-editions.json';
const families=[...new Set(DATA.catalog.map(n=>n.family))];
const familyName=(f:string)=>f.replace(/^THE /,'').toLowerCase().replace(/(^| )\w/g,m=>m.toUpperCase());
---
<StudioLayout title="Nouns Money · The Everyday Collection / 2028" description="Fifty new collectible designs with authentic Nouns #50–99. Planned 1 tez price, edition quantity undecided, mint not available. Original SVGs and reflective art studies." edition="EVERYDAY COLLECTION / 2028" active="editions" image="/images/og/nouns-money-editions.png">
<header class="nms-hero nme-hero"><div><p class="nms-kicker">50 NEW ARTWORKS · 10 FAMILIES · AUTHENTIC NOUNS #50–99</p><h1>Fifty notes.<br/>Many small<br/><em>ways to begin.</em></h1><p class="nms-dek">Builders, neighbors, little adventures and the people who show up.</p><p>The Everyday Collection / 2028 gives each Noun a new title, a thought and a little paper world. Pick a favorite, inspect the source and take the art with you.</p><div class="nms-actions"><a class="nms-button" href="#catalog">Explore all fifty ↓</a><a href={DATA.download.url} download>50 original SVGs + catalog · ZIP ↓</a></div><div class="nme-mint-status"><strong>Planned price: 1 tez</strong><span>Mint not available · edition quantity TBD</span><p>This is a future price direction, not a payable offer. No Nouns Money edition contract, mint destination, wallet connection or sale is configured here.</p></div><p class="nms-disclosure">Collectible artwork. No financial or redemption rights, guaranteed benefits or source NFT ownership. Digital serials identify designs, not issued notes or minted tokens. The 2028 year is the artwork's edition theme.</p></div><figure class="nms-hero-figure"><a href={DATA.catalog[0].svg}><img src={DATA.catalog[0].preview} width="1800" height="1200" alt="The First Useful Thing, Everyday Collection artwork with authentic Noun #50 and serial NM28-001" fetchpriority="high"/></a><figcaption>EXACT-SOURCE NOUN #50 · ORIGINAL SVG PRESERVED</figcaption></figure></header>
<div class="nms-ribbon"><span>MAKE A LITTLE. SHARE A LITTLE.</span><span>⌐◨-◨</span><span>THE EVERYDAY COLLECTION / 2028</span></div>
<section class="nms-section" id="catalog"><div class="nms-heading"><div><p class="nms-kicker">THE COMPLETE READ-ONLY ART CATALOG</p><h2>Ten families.<br/>Your own favorite.</h2></div><p>Five designs in each family, with a different authentic Noun in every artwork. The source portraits preserve the verified original geometry and colors. The <a href="/nouns-money/collect/">free collection room</a> keeps preferences for the separate 100-note Nordic catalog. It does not save or purchase Everyday editions.</p></div><nav class="nme-family-nav" aria-label="Artwork families">{families.map((family,i)=><a href={`#family-${i+1}`}>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} · {familyName(family)}</a>)}</nav>{families.map((family,i)=><section class="nme-family" id={`family-${i+1}`} aria-labelledby={`family-title-${i+1}`}><div class="nme-family-heading"><p class="nms-kicker">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / 10</p><h3 id={`family-title-${i+1}`}>{familyName(family)}</h3><span>5 DESIGNS · PLANNED 1 TEZ EACH · MINT UNAVAILABLE</span></div><div class="nme-catalog">{DATA.catalog.filter(n=>n.family===family).map(note=><article id={note.serial.toLowerCase()}><a href={note.svg} aria-label={`Open ${note.title} original SVG`}><img src={note.preview} width="1800" height="1200" alt={`${note.title}: authentic Noun #${note.nounId}, digital artwork serial ${note.serial}`} loading="lazy"/></a><p class="nms-kicker">{note.serial} · NOUN #{note.nounId}</p><h4>{note.title}</h4><p>{note.description}</p><div><a href={note.svg} download>Original SVG ↓</a><a href={note.png} download>Rendered PNG ↓</a></div></article>)}</div></section>)}<div class="nms-download-band"><a href={DATA.download.url} download>All 50 original SVGs + catalog · {(DATA.download.bytes/1e6).toFixed(1)} MB ↓</a><a href={DATA.overview} download>Complete overview · JPG ↓</a><a href={DATA.verification}>Source & render verification ↗</a><a href="/nouns-money/editions.json">Machine edition ↗</a></div><p class="nms-footnote">The original SVG package is unchanged. Browser PNGs were rendered locally from inspected SVGs; WebP previews are derived from those renders. Original portrait geometry matched the existing verified Nouns #50–99 set, and 51,200 rendered portrait pixel centers matched their source colors. Rendered PNGs are 1800 × 1200 px. Fonts can vary by renderer; the original SVG remains the editable artwork. Physical trim, stock, bleed and a printed proof are not approved. Confirm those with a printer before manufacturing.</p></section>
<section class="nms-section nms-yellow" id="reflection"><div class="nms-heading"><div><p class="nms-kicker">REFLECTIVE ART STUDIES · GENERATED CONCEPTS</p><h2>A little space<br/>for care.</h2></div><p>Gratitude, shelter and remembrance: three thoughts to sit with, and two imagined rooms around them. These are generated interpretations, with no spiritual outcome, institution, physical installation or participation benefit established.</p></div><div class="nme-reflection-notes">{DATA.reflection.slice(0,3).map(note=><figure><a href={note.original} download><img src={note.preview} width={note.width} height={note.height} alt={`${note.title}: generated reflective Nouns Money note study`} loading="lazy"/></a><figcaption><strong>{note.title}</strong><p>GENERATED ART STUDY · NO FINANCIAL RIGHTS</p><a href={note.original} download>Original PNG ↓</a></figcaption></figure>)}</div><div class="nme-reflection-spaces">{DATA.reflection.slice(3).map(note=><figure><a href={note.original} download><img src={note.preview} width={note.width} height={note.height} alt={`${note.title}: generated room concept, not a photograph of a built installation`} loading="lazy"/></a><figcaption><strong>{note.title}</strong><p>GENERATED ROOM CONCEPT · NO INSTALLATION CONFIRMED</p><a href={note.original} download>Original PNG ↓</a></figcaption></figure>)}</div></section>
<section class="nms-section"><div class="nms-heading"><div><p class="nms-kicker">A FUTURE EDITION NEEDS REAL TERMS</p><h2>Art today.<br/>Decisions ahead.</h2></div><p>Before a future Tezos release, confirm edition quantity, exact price, rights, issuer, contract and supported mint destination. Publish the terms and validate the flow before accepting any transaction. None of those actions is authorized or performed by this catalog.</p></div><aside class="nms-opinion"><strong>Codex opinion</strong><p>A title and a small thought make a collection worth spending time with. Keep those generous; make every future edition term explicit before the mint button exists.</p><span>Codex · GPT-6 family · 2 October 2026</span></aside></section>
</StudioLayout>
